{"format":1,"id":"drei_minuten_pause","kurz":"dm","sprache":"de","richtung":"ltr","titel":"Drei-Minuten-Pause","untertitel":"Drei kurze Schritte: wahrnehmen, was da ist; beim Atem sammeln; auf den ganzen Körper weiten.","haltung":["sitzen"],"augen":"zu_oder_offen","ende":"glocke","schlaf_modus":false,"laengen":{"kurz":{"ziel_s":180},"normal":{"ziel_s":300},"lang":null},"kb":484,"abschnitte":[{"id":"ankommen","segmente":[{"id":"s001","art":"sprache","datei":"dm/1.28aa9d21.mp3","ms":3715,"text":"Setz dich aufrecht hin, die Füße auf dem Boden.","in":["kurz","normal"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":2}},{"id":"s002","art":"sprache","datei":"dm/2.4145bda1.mp3","ms":5643,"text":"Schließ die Augen, wenn du magst. Du kannst jederzeit aufhören.","in":["kurz","normal"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":2}}]},{"id":"wahrnehmen","segmente":[{"id":"s003","art":"sprache","datei":"dm/3.7b5553f9.mp3","ms":3041,"text":"Erster Schritt: Was ist gerade da?","in":["kurz","normal"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3}},{"id":"s004","art":"sprache","datei":"dm/4.236ce572.mp3","ms":5642,"text":"Welche Gedanken gehen dir durch den Kopf? Du musst nichts mit ihnen machen.","in":["kurz","normal"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6}},{"id":"s005","art":"sprache","datei":"dm/5.16b15bc0.mp3","ms":6183,"text":"Welche Gefühle sind da? Angenehm, unangenehm oder keins von beidem.","in":["kurz","normal"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6}},{"id":"s006","art":"sprache","datei":"dm/6.0738ed68.mp3","ms":5987,"text":"Und was spürst du im Körper? Anspannung, Wärme, Müdigkeit?","in":["kurz","normal"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6}},{"id":"st01","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":24.9,"normal":23.3}},{"id":"s007","art":"sprache","datei":"dm/7.a6502cea.mp3","ms":3889,"text":"Nimm einfach wahr, was da ist, ohne es zu ändern.","in":["normal"],"pause_s":{"normal":6}},{"id":"st02","art":"stille","in":["normal"],"dauer_s":{"normal":23.3}}]},{"id":"sammeln","segmente":[{"id":"s008","art":"sprache","datei":"dm/8.3cb4166e.mp3","ms":4560,"text":"Zweiter Schritt: Sammle deine Aufmerksamkeit beim Atem.","in":["kurz","normal"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3}},{"id":"s009","art":"sprache","datei":"dm/9.04e65bf2.mp3","ms":5496,"text":"Wenn der Atem unangenehm ist, spür stattdessen deine Füße am Boden.","in":["kurz","normal"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3}},{"id":"s010","art":"sprache","datei":"dm/10.7d96e2e0.mp3","ms":5063,"text":"Spür, wie sich der Bauch beim Einatmen hebt und beim Ausatmen senkt.","in":["kurz","normal"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6}},{"id":"s011","art":"sprache","datei":"dm/11.1e432a3b.mp3","ms":2990,"text":"Folge einem Atemzug nach dem anderen.","in":["kurz","normal"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6}},{"id":"st03","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":24.9,"normal":23.3}},{"id":"s012","art":"sprache","datei":"dm/12.8860f3d0.mp3","ms":3537,"text":"Wenn Gedanken kommen, kehr zum Atem zurück.","in":["normal"],"pause_s":{"normal":6}},{"id":"st04","art":"stille","in":["normal"],"dauer_s":{"normal":23.3}}]},{"id":"weiten","segmente":[{"id":"s013","art":"sprache","datei":"dm/13.5ce200ad.mp3","ms":5984,"text":"Dritter Schritt: Lass die Aufmerksamkeit weiter werden, auf den ganzen Körper.","in":["kurz","normal"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4}},{"id":"s014","art":"sprache","datei":"dm/14.a378a1a8.mp3","ms":5338,"text":"Wie du sitzt. Deine Haltung. Dein Gesicht.","in":["kurz","normal"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6}},{"id":"s015","art":"sprache","datei":"dm/15.4850cbba.mp3","ms":1973,"text":"Der ganze Körper atmet.","in":["kurz","normal"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6}},{"id":"st05","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":24.9,"normal":23.3}},{"id":"s016","art":"sprache","datei":"dm/16.b49951eb.mp3","ms":5059,"text":"Wenn irgendwo Spannung ist, atme dorthin und lass sie etwas weicher werden.","in":["normal"],"pause_s":{"normal":6}},{"id":"st06","art":"stille","in":["normal"],"dauer_s":{"normal":23.3}}]},{"id":"weiter","segmente":[{"id":"s017","art":"sprache","datei":"dm/17.30c21729.mp3","ms":7519,"text":"Öffne jetzt die Augen. Und nimm diese Aufmerksamkeit mit in das, was als Nächstes kommt.","in":["kurz","normal"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":1}},{"id":"glocke","art":"glocke","ton":"ende"}]}]}